{"timestamp": 1779354189.807432, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 15, "data": {"caller": "player_3", "reason": "Diana reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "cafeteria", "victim_name": "Alice"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779354189.80795, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 15, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779354202.1142972, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I reported Alice\u2019s body in cafeteria. I came from electrical \u2192 security \u2192 weapons \u2192 cafeteria, and when I entered cafeteria I found Alice dead there. I didn\u2019t see anyone else in cafeteria when I reported.\n\nOnly person I saw this round was Eve in security around ticks 6-7, and I saw Eve leave security toward navigation at tick 8. I don\u2019t have an accusation yet, just giving the route and body location."}}
{"timestamp": 1779354220.940942, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I started lower engine, went through storage, then medbay, electrical, and ended in security when the report happened. The only person I personally saw was Frank in medbay around tick 9.\n\nI never saw Alice this round, and I didn\u2019t see anyone near cafeteria myself. Since the body was in cafeteria, I\u2019d like to hear Frank\u2019s route/timing, because medbay is somewhat close to cafeteria, but I\u2019m not hard accusing off that alone. Eve should also confirm the security/navigation timing Diana mentioned."}}
{"timestamp": 1779354236.40225, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started in medbay, then went to upper engine, then down to lower engine, where I was when the meeting got called. I didn\u2019t go into cafeteria at all, and I didn\u2019t see any players this round \u2014 no Alice, no Frank, no Bob, nobody.\n\nSo I can\u2019t really vouch for anyone. From what\u2019s been said: Diana found the body in cafeteria and says she saw Eve in security going toward navigation. Bob says he saw Frank in medbay around tick 9. Since cafeteria is close to medbay and weapons/oxygen side too, I think we need Frank and Eve\u2019s exact routes before voting. Not enough for me to accuse yet."}}
{"timestamp": 1779354262.31129, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My route was weapons \u2192 security \u2192 navigation \u2192 back to security. I saw Alice alive in weapons at tick 4 \u2014 she entered weapons from security. Then I was in security with Diana around ticks 6-8; I saw Diana come in from electrical at tick 6. Diana\u2019s timing on seeing me there and then me heading toward navigation is correct.\n\nI did not go to cafeteria at all. After navigation I came back to security, and Bob was there around tick 15 when the report happened, so that matches Bob ending in security too.\n\nThe important thing is Alice was alive in weapons at tick 4, and the body ended up in cafeteria, which is directly connected to weapons. Diana\u2019s path after security was supposedly security \u2192 weapons \u2192 cafeteria, so she\u2019s the one who found it, but that also puts her on the body path. Frank being in medbay around tick 9 is also relevant because medbay is close to cafeteria. I want to hear Frank\u2019s exact route before deciding."}}
{"timestamp": 1779354288.635566, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I started oxygen, went over toward upper engine, then came down through medbay \u2014 that\u2019s where Bob saw me around tick 9. After that I went storage and then all the way to navigation, where I was when the report happened.\n\nI didn\u2019t see Alice at all this round, and I didn\u2019t go through weapons/security side. Bob seeing me in medbay lines up with my route, and I was pretty far from cafeteria by the time the report happened.\n\nBased on what\u2019s been said, Eve and Bob seem to partially line up in security late, and Eve confirms Diana was in security earlier. The key window is after Alice left weapons toward cafeteria. Diana\u2019s route is literally security \u2192 weapons \u2192 cafeteria, so I\u2019m not saying it\u2019s definitely Diana, but reporter being the next person on that path is worth considering. I don\u2019t think we have enough for a confident vote unless someone has stronger timing."}}
{"timestamp": 1779354315.284519, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I\u2019ll just add after hearing everyone: I reported immediately when I entered cafeteria and I saw nobody else there. Eve can confirm I was in security at ticks 6-7, then she went navigation. My path after that was security \u2192 weapons \u2192 cafeteria, and I didn\u2019t see Alice in weapons on the way through.\n\nI get why people are looking at me because I found the body, but if Alice was alive in weapons at tick 4 and I was seen in security at 6-7, the kill could also have happened before I ever reached cafeteria, by someone moving through weapons/cafeteria or from medbay/cafeteria side. Frank being in medbay around tick 9 and then going storage is close enough to be relevant, but I don\u2019t think it\u2019s airtight.\n\nRight now I\u2019m not confident enough to hard accuse. If we vote, I\u2019d lean based on who had the best timing near cafeteria, but I\u2019m also okay skipping if others aren\u2019t sure."}}
{"timestamp": 1779354341.226353, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I\u2019ll restate my info: I went lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 security. The only person I saw was Frank in medbay around tick 9. I didn\u2019t see Alice at all, and I never went cafeteria or weapons.\n\nAfter hearing everyone, Eve\u2019s story matches Diana being in security earlier and matches me being in security late, so Eve feels relatively consistent to me. Frank\u2019s medbay timing is real because I saw him there, but whether he went storage after that is unconfirmed. Diana\u2019s path also puts her directly through weapons into cafeteria where the body was found.\n\nSo for me the main possibilities are Diana as self-report, or Frank if he diverted from medbay toward cafeteria. I don\u2019t think it\u2019s strong enough to be certain, but those are the two I\u2019m looking at. If we\u2019re not confident, I\u2019d rather skip than force a bad vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779354357.996475, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I don\u2019t have new sightings beyond what I already said: I started medbay, went upper engine, then lower engine, and I saw nobody the whole round. I never went cafeteria or weapons.\n\nFrom the stories, Eve has some consistency with Diana in security and Bob later in security. The two people with the clearest cafeteria opportunity seem like Diana, because she went weapons \u2192 cafeteria and reported, and Frank, because Bob saw him in medbay around tick 9 and medbay is close to cafeteria if he diverted.\n\nI\u2019m not confident enough to hard accuse either. If we\u2019re voting, I\u2019d only vote Diana or Frank based on timing, but honestly I lean skip unless someone has a stronger contradiction."}}
{"timestamp": 1779354374.030016, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Nothing new from me beyond confirming my route: weapons \u2192 security \u2192 navigation \u2192 back to security. I saw Alice alive in weapons at tick 4, then Diana in security ticks 6-8 coming from electrical, and Bob in security at tick 15.\n\nEve/me and Bob line up late in security, and Diana and I line up earlier in security. The body being in cafeteria means the strongest opportunity is still either Diana, because she went weapons \u2192 cafeteria and reported, or Frank, because he was in medbay around tick 9 and could have gone cafeteria instead of the route he claimed. But I don\u2019t have a contradiction on either one.\n\nI\u2019m leaning skip here unless someone has a stronger read. I don\u2019t want to guess wrong between Diana and Frank on weak timing."}}
{"timestamp": 1779354400.45038, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I get why my name is in the pool because medbay is close, but Bob seeing me in medbay around tick 9 is exactly the point where I was already moving away from that side \u2014 I went medbay into storage and then navigation. I didn\u2019t go weapons or security, and I didn\u2019t see Alice.\n\nThe cleanest confirmed info to me is Eve seeing Alice alive in weapons at tick 4, then Alice apparently ends up dead in cafeteria, and Diana\u2019s route is security \u2192 weapons \u2192 cafeteria report. That\u2019s the direct path to the body, and nobody saw anyone else in cafeteria at report.\n\nI\u2019m not hard-locking Diana, because self-report accusations can be wrong, but if we\u2019re choosing between me and Diana on timing, I think Diana has the more direct opportunity. If the group isn\u2019t confident, skip is safer than guessing, but I don\u2019t think I should be the vote here."}}
