{"timestamp": 1779354856.670515, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I reported Bob\u2019s body in Security. My route this round was upper engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons \u2192 security. I didn\u2019t see anyone at all on the way, and when I got into Security Bob\u2019s body was there, so I reported immediately. I don\u2019t have a suspect yet, just wanted to get the location out."}}
{"timestamp": 1779354881.6412559, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I started medbay, went electrical, then toward nav/storage. I saw Bob alive earlier around medbay, but I didn\u2019t see Alice at all this round. End of round I was in storage with Diana, so she can confirm I wasn\u2019t near the report at the very end.\n\nCharlie reporting in Security is useful info, but since he says he saw nobody on the way, we don\u2019t have much to go on. Could be a normal report, could be self-report, but I\u2019m not hard accusing yet. Did anyone else see Bob after medbay or see anyone coming from Security/weapons?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779354905.3937652, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I started in Security, then went Navigation, then Storage. I saw Eve in Security around ticks 6 and 7, and I didn\u2019t see Bob\u2019s body there when I left. End of round I was in Storage with Frank, so I can confirm Frank wasn\u2019t at Security right at the end.\n\nSo for Bob in Security, the people connected to that area are Charlie as reporter and Eve who I personally saw there earlier. Frank\u2019s story lines up with being away late. I\u2019m not clearing Charlie completely because self-report is possible, but Eve needs to explain her route after Security and whether she saw Bob. If Eve\u2019s route is vague, I\u2019m leaning Eve here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779354943.3852491, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I need to correct Diana a bit: I wasn\u2019t trying to hide Security, but my actual route was Storage \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Electrical \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Upper Engine. From Electrical/near that side I saw Diana in Security around ticks 6-8, and I did not see a body then. I also saw Bob alive in Security around tick 15.\n\nSo Bob died after tick 15 in Security. I ended in Upper Engine, nowhere near the report at the end. Frank and Diana are vouching each other in Storage late, which makes them less likely for the final Security kill unless one of them is lying with timing.\n\nThat leaves Charlie as the one who entered Security and reported, with no one seeing him on the way. It could be a real report, but from the info we have, Charlie has the clearest opportunity after Bob was last alive. I\u2019m leaning Charlie here over Diana/Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779354972.394347, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I\u2019m obviously going to push back on Eve pinning this on me. I came in from Weapons into Security and reported immediately \u2014 I never saw Bob alive, only the body.\n\nThe big thing for me is Eve\u2019s story: Diana says she saw Eve in Security early, Eve says she wasn\u2019t there but also says she saw Bob alive in Security around tick 15. That makes Eve the last person claiming to have seen Bob alive at the crime scene. Frank and Diana vouch each other late in Storage, so between the two of us, Eve had way more connection to Security before the report.\n\nI get that self-report is possible in general, but from my POV Eve\u2019s route and the \u201cBob alive in Security tick 15\u201d detail are the most suspicious. I\u2019m leaning Eve."}}
{"timestamp": 1779354999.402385, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I\u2019m still leaning Eve after hearing both sides. The Diana/Eve mismatch is the biggest thing: Diana says Eve was around Security early, Eve says she wasn\u2019t, but then Eve also claims Bob was alive in Security around tick 15. That makes Eve the last person with direct info on Bob at the body location.\n\nI only personally saw Bob earlier around Medbay, not late enough to help much. Diana and I were together in Storage at the end, so I\u2019m comfortable saying she didn\u2019t make the final Security kill. Charlie self-report is possible, but Eve\u2019s route/story has more contradictions and more connection to Bob in Security.\n\nI think Eve is the better vote here unless someone has a hard clear."}}
{"timestamp": 1779355024.4899452, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I\u2019m going to be clear: I definitely saw Eve in Security at ticks 6 and 7. That wasn\u2019t \u201cnear Security\u201d from my perspective \u2014 she was there with me, and there was no body when I left for Navigation.\n\nEve denying being in Security while also saying she saw Bob alive in Security around tick 15 is the contradiction I can\u2019t get past. That makes her the last person placing Bob alive at the body location. Frank and I were together in Storage at the end, so I\u2019m confident Frank didn\u2019t do the final kill, and he can vouch the same for me.\n\nCharlie self-report is possible, but Eve has both the route issue and the Bob-last-seen info. I\u2019m voting Eve."}}
{"timestamp": 1779355063.506686, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I\u2019m going to defend myself clearly because this is getting twisted: my route was Storage \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Electrical \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Upper Engine. I was not camping inside Security. I saw Diana in Security around ticks 6-8, and I saw Bob alive in Security around tick 15 from that side of the map. I gave that info because it narrows the kill window \u2014 hiding it would\u2019ve been easier if I were Duck.\n\nDiana keeps saying she \u201cdefinitely\u201d saw me in Security, but from my perspective I was around Electrical/Medbay side, not inside Security. That mismatch is now being used to vote me, and I think that\u2019s suspicious.\n\nAlso, Frank only clears Diana for the very end in Storage. That does not clear Diana for killing Bob after tick 15 and then moving to Storage. Charlie self-report is still possible too, but Diana is the one pushing a false version of where I was.\n\nI\u2019m Goose. If you vote me here, you\u2019re probably handing the Duck the game. I think the safer vote is Diana, because her claim about me is wrong and she had time to kill before being seen with Frank late."}}
